150	/*
151	╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
152	║  UTILITY CLASSES                                                   ║
153	╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
154	*/
155	
156	/* Screen-reader-only. Visually hidden but available to AT.
157	   Used for: skip links (visible on focus), alternate spoken pronunciations
158	   (e.g., the dual-span "arXiv" → "archive" pattern), "(opens in new tab)"
159	   notices, sr-only headings that label a region for landmark nav. */
160	.is-sr-only {
161	  position: absolute !important;
162	  width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important;
163	  padding: 0 !important; margin: -1px !important;
164	  overflow: hidden !important;
165	  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;
166	  white-space: nowrap !important;
167	  border: 0 !important;
168	}
169	
170	/* External-link icon. Inline SVG (Lucide-style "external-link") used at
171	   the end of every link with target="_blank". Paired with sr-only text
172	   "(opens in new tab)". Both are required by the priority list. */
173	.external-icon {
174	  width: 11px; height: 11px;
175	  vertical-align: -1px;
176	  margin-left: 4px;
177	  opacity: 0.7;
178	  flex-shrink: 0;
179	}
180	
181	/* Skip-link visible only on keyboard focus. The first focusable element
182	   on the page; lets keyboard/AT users bypass repetitive nav. */
183	.ds-skip-link {
184	  position: absolute;
185	  top: -100px; left: 8px;
186	  z-index: 200;
187	  background: var(--arxiv-ink);
188	  color: #fff;
189	  padding: 10px 16px;
190	  border-radius: 4px;
191	  text-decoration: none;
192	  font-weight: 600;
193	}
194	.ds-skip-link:focus-visible {
195	  top: 8px;
196	  outline: 3px solid var(--arxiv-focus-ring-dark);
197	  outline-offset: 2px;
198	}
199	
200	/*
201	╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
202	║  COMPONENT: Universal header (arXiv chrome)                        ║
203	╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
204	  Intent
205	    The black bar at the top of every arXiv public page (post-Cornell
206	    spinout). NOT sticky — it scrolls away like any other content
207	    (decided 2026-06-11; sticky chrome is exceptional at arXiv and
208	    reader-only). Contains the logo and primary nav.
209	
210	  Accessibility decisions (priorities.md: information architecture,
211	                           arxiv→archive pronunciation)
212	    - <header><nav aria-label="Main navigation"> is the landmark.
213	    - Logo aria-label and image alt say "archive" (the spoken pronunciation
214	      Ginsparg intended via Greek χ in "arXiv"). Dan Miner's research
215	      finding: screen readers without this hint say "ar-zhiv" / Roman
216	      numeral "XIV" — gibberish.
217	    - The search button opens a modal dialog (see search-overlay block);
218	      Cmd+K also opens it.
219	    - Decorative SVGs use aria-hidden + focusable="false" so SR doesn't
220	      announce them; the visible text labels are the accessible names.
221	    - Visible "About" link added so newcomers can self-orient (the
222	      "What is arXiv?" priority — research voice: Dan Miner "I have no
223	      clue what I am walking into").
224	
225	  Tradeoff
226	    Header is Repository Brown (var(--arxiv-ink)) — same as the design system's
227	    background-dark token. Phase-2 spinout brand (post-June 2026). Black
228	    in phase 1 was visually identical so no transition work needed.
229	*/
230	
231	/* Top announcement banner — light-blue dismissable strip above the
232	   black header. Matches the approved spinout-header-footer treatment.
233	   Stacked above the header (header stays sticky; banner scrolls away). */
234	.ds-announcement {
235	  display: flex;
236	  align-items: center;
237	  justify-content: center;
238	  gap: 8px;
239	  padding: 6px 16px;
240	  background: var(--arxiv-active-bg);
241	  color: var(--arxiv-ink);
242	  font-family: var(--arxiv-font-sans);
243	  font-size: 0.8125rem;
244	  font-weight: 500;
245	  position: relative;
246	}
247	.ds-announcement-glyph {
248	  width: 18px;
249	  height: 18px;
250	  flex-shrink: 0;
251	}
252	.ds-announcement-text {
253	  font-weight: 600;
254	}
255	.ds-announcement-link {
256	  color: var(--arxiv-link-blue);
257	  text-decoration: underline;
